      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so lately i've been having these really weird moments where i just get totally confused out of nowhere. like i'll be talking and suddenly i can't find a basic word or i just feel spaced out for a few mins. its kinda scary but honestly i havent been sleeping well and work has been insane. do u think this is just like brain fog or maybe just stress?",
